669A OBS scripts (Node Playwright library, not the MCP). Node 20 (nvm); Playwright resolves from the worktree's frontend/node_modules or the sibling main checkout's. lib.cjs is 668A's lib.cjs with the raw dir renamed (/tmp/669A-$PHASE-raw/); it re-uses ../../../661B/walk/scripts/common.cjs (theme, sidebar cookie, console watch, sheet()).
  00-seed.cjs     RUN ONCE (done for before; idempotent — a re-run only appends a run entry to seed.json runs[]). Read-only inventory of every surface's data; probes + shoots the naturally empty /compliance/requests BEFORE the write; then the ONE seed write: a data request through the real "New Request" dialog (Acme Corp, Access Request). Writes ../seed.json (ids read by 01/02).
  01-capture.cjs  capture: 25 targets × alice/carol × 1024/1440 × light/dark (91 page loads) + interactions (Alice 1440 light, Alice 1024 dark, Carol 1440 light). Read-only EXCEPT one recorded write per run: the "Run Conflict Check" submit (Alice 1440 light, "Pillay Holdings", New Matter), done after all page loads. Raw → /tmp/669A-$PHASE-raw/. NO_WRITE=1 skips that submit (dry runs only; the committed before run did not set it).
  02-assemble.cjs JSON (measurements / sel-compat / console / discover) + 19 contact sheets + 8 kink crops → ../../$PHASE/.
  probe.cjs       the in-page probe (structure-agnostic: raw tables / hand-rolled headers and DataTable / PageHeader alike).
OBS-after (same data, frontend rebuilt from the slice head; do NOT re-seed), from this directory, unedited:
  PHASE=after node 01-capture.cjs && PHASE=after STACK="<frontend image + SHA>" node 02-assemble.cjs
